VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_RedSilent::
    .string "RED: ……$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_RedHeals::
    .string "RED takes out a thermos and lets\n"
    .string "your POKéMON drink. They feel\n"
    .string "fine again.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_Cold::
    .string "The THRONE ROOM is freezing. RED\n"
    .string "kneels at its center, the BLACK\l"
    .string "OPAL held in both hands.\p"
    .string "Nothing moves. Nothing breathes.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_KronosIntro::
    .string "KRONOS: Welcome, little keeper.\n"
    .string "I am the last door.\p"
    .string "Three floors, three of us. You\n"
    .string "beat VESPER. You beat SELENE.\p"
    .string "I will not lie to you. I am not\n"
    .string "here to win. The boss asked me\l"
    .string "for five minutes of your time.\p"
    .string "Five minutes is all the PENDANT\n"
    .string "needs. Shall we spend them\l"
    .string "politely?$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_KronosDefeat::
    .string "…Good. That was exactly five\n"
    .string "minutes.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_KronosLamp::
    .string "KRONOS: Do you feel it? The\n"
    .string "warmth against your chest?\p"
    .string "Ten stones are his now. The heart\n"
    .string "of them all hangs round your neck.\l"
    .string "It cannot be taken: a garnet torn\l"
    .string "from its keeper simply shatters.\p"
    .string "The wish sleeps under the LEAGUE.\n"
    .string "It wakes for one person only: a\l"
    .string "CHAMPION who wears the heart.\p"
    .string "The boss could climb the road\n"
    .string "himself. The star would sleep\l"
    .string "through him. So he needs you to\l"
    .string "carry it all the way up.\p"
    .string "We never had to catch you, kid.\n"
    .string "You were the lamp.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_PendantHeats::
    .string "Your PENDANT burns. A red glow\n"
    .string "spills across the floor.\p"
    .string "Above RED, a pale shape of shadow\n"
    .string "turns toward the light you carry.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_StonesCall::
    .string "A cry rings inside your head,\n"
    .string "not in the air. A PSYCHIC cry.\p"
    .string "The BLACK OPAL slips from RED's\n"
    .string "open hands and floats away.\p"
    .string "Your bag shudders. The TOPAZ\n"
    .string "tears loose and flies to the\l"
    .string "shape. Far away, a case snaps\l"
    .string "open: the APATITE answers too.\p"
    .string "Below, the seven stones sing and\n"
    .string "rise through the floor.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_BossVoice1::
    .string "???: Thank you, child of the\n"
    .string "garnet.\p"
    .string "Ten stones. Ten voices of the same\n"
    .string "old cry. You carried the last\l"
    .string "ones to me yourself.\p"
    .string "Do not blame the one in red. His\n"
    .string "hands were never meant to hold a\l"
    .string "world's grief. Mine are.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_BossVoice2::
    .string "???: The wish sleeps under the\n"
    .string "LEAGUE. It wakes for a CHAMPION\l"
    .string "who carries the heart-stone.\p"
    .string "So climb, child. Beat the old\n"
    .string "CHAMPION. Sit on the throne with\l"
    .string "the garnet on your chest and let\l"
    .string "the star open its eye.\p"
    .string "And when it does, I will be in the\n"
    .string "doorway. I take the wish from\l"
    .string "whoever holds it.\p"
    .string "Stay home, if you prefer. Then\n"
    .string "nothing wakes, and the clocks\l"
    .string "keep bending. The choice is yours.\p"
    .string "Time is the one thing nobody gets\n"
    .string "back. Do not waste it.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_ShapeGone::
    .string "When the light returns, the shape\n"
    .string "is gone. The stones are gone.\p"
    .string "The room is only a room again.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_KronosLeaves::
    .string "KRONOS: He did not even look at\n"
    .string "me. Heh. I am done being a door.\p"
    .string "Go to the LEAGUE, kid. Try to\n"
    .string "stop him.\p"
    .string "KRONOS throws down a smoke\n"
    .string "pellet and is gone.$"

VictoryRoadLair_3F_Text_RedAfter::
    .string "RED rises. He is not hurt: the\n"
    .string "OPAL left his hands, nothing\l"
    .string "more.\p"
    .string "He looks north, toward the LEAGUE,\n"
    .string "then at you. No anger. A slow\l"
    .string "nod: he is coming too.$"
